    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（19广东）某单位男、女干部人数相等，男干部中60%有基层工作经历，女干部中50%有基层工作经历，则在该单位全体干部中，有基层工作经历的占：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "55%"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "60%"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "65%"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "70%"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          26
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          20
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-06-p026.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第20页",
            "pdfPage": 26
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看男女人数相等，两个比例的权重相同。这时才可以直接取平均。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "有基层经历占比=\\frac{60\\%+50\\%}{2}=55\\%"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "例如各设100人，有经历的60+50=110人，占200人的55%，所以选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "两组分母量相等时，混合比值才等于两个比值的算术平均。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
