    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26河南事考）某园艺师将浓度为40%的营养液与浓度为15%的营养液混合，配制成若干浓度为25%的营养液用于浇灌花卉。已知配制过程中，浓度为40%的营养液比浓度为15%的营养液少使用了600毫升，则浓度为25%的营养液共配制了（）毫升。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "2400"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3000"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3600"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4200"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          27
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          21
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-08-p027.webp",
            "alt": "和差倍比问题（二） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第21页",
            "pdfPage": 27
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-08-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s02-t03-drill-08",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先求40%与15%两种营养液的用量比：(25-15)∶(40-25)=2∶3。高浓度比低浓度少600毫升，差1份就是600毫升，合计5份。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "总量=600\\times(2+3)=3000\\text{毫升}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以选B。核验高浓度1200、低浓度1800，溶质量480+270=750，占3000的25%。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "已知两种混合原料差量时，用差份确定一份，再求和份。"
        }
      ],
